# penny.ai UI Design Tokens

All new UI must use global tokens from `src/theme/tokens.ts` and theme colors from `useAppTheme()`.

## Typography

Import and spread `typography.*` — never hard-code `fontSize` or `fontWeight` in components.

```tsx
// BAD
<Text style={{fontSize: 16, fontWeight: '700'}}>Title</Text>

// GOOD
import {typography} from '../../theme/tokens';
<Text style={typography.cardTitle}>Title</Text>
```

Token map: `screenTitle` (page headers), `cardTitle` (sections/sheets), `rowTitle` (list rows), `amountHero`/`amount`/`amountRow` (numbers), `label` (eyebrows), `tag` (pills), `body`/`caption`/`tabLabel`.

Bold (`700`) is reserved for screen titles and amounts only. Prefer `600` for row/card titles.

## Colors

- Single accent: `theme.colors.primary` (`#0A84FF`)
- Semantic only: `theme.colors.error`, `theme.colors.custom.success`, `theme.colors.custom.danger`
- Tags/chips/labels: neutral gray via `neutralTag` or `getTagColor()` — no per-category rainbow colors
- Charts only: `dataPalette` from tokens — never use `dataPalette` for UI elements

```tsx
// BAD — flashy per-tag color
backgroundColor: getTagColor(tag).text

// GOOD — neutral tag pill
import {neutralTag} from '../../theme/tokens';
backgroundColor: neutralTag.tint
```

## Spacing and layout

Use `spacing.*`, `radius.*`, and `popup.*` from tokens. No magic numbers for padding, margins, or border radius.

## Bottom nav

Tab bar styling lives in `app/(tabs)/_layout.tsx`. Use `typography.tabLabel`, icon size 22, height ~72 iOS / ~58 Android.
